{"title":"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is a mapping of the plane into itself such that the vertices of every\nequilateral triangle of side one are mapped onto the vertices of a congruent triangle.\nShow that the map <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is distance preserving, i.e., <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c74128eb6011cb3860af486283f4a176955f22a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d(p, q) = d(f(p), f(q))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"172\" height=\"18\" /> for all points\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in the plane, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/2/eb271c6519cb12b0c91a11a2cfe8b6501e854e11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d(x, y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> denotes the distance between the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in\nthe plane. In other words, if any two points that are one unit apart are mapped to points\nthat are one unit apart, then any two points are mapped to two points that are the same\ndistance as their pre-images.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2014 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/P